{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","伊莎贝拉"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名内向文静的辅助，能够记录友军的增益并对其重复施加。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","嗯，我在这里"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Yes, I'm here."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","学到了新知识"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","I learned something new."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","你在……这一页"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","This page is for you."],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","姐姐，结束了……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","It's over... Silvina..."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","知识会带来胜利"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","Knowledge brings victory."],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","诅咒，也是一种知识"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_i18n/en","Curses are also a kind of knowledge."],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我记得这里……啊，有事吗？"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Hmm... I remember reading this passage. Oh, is something the matter."],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","书会告诉我一切"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","This book contains the knowledge I seek."],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","应该在书上有记载……"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","All knowledge lies within these pages."],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","谢谢，很棒的礼物。能和姐姐分享就好了……"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","谢谢你，我很喜欢。"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","灾厄巫童"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","在别人认为你会带来灾厄的时候，你最好真的会。"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","拾卷忆梦"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","翻开泛黄的书页，文字构筑的世界如同梦境般光怪陆离。"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","幻化商店购买获得。"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","史诗"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","稍微看会儿书吧"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","姐姐现在在做什么呢？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","蛋糕，很美味……"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","伊莎贝拉和姐姐西尔维娜都沉默寡言，但西尔维娜是认为语言沟通过于低效，而伊莎贝拉则是纯粹地不善言辞。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","伊莎贝拉对书可谓是来者不拒，为此，对阅读没什么兴趣的西尔维娜也不得不经常翻阅书本，为她筛选掉一些不适合她的书籍。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","除了“姐姐”之外，伊莎贝拉学到的另一个重要的词语就是“友人”。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","作为控制西尔维娜的人质，伊莎贝拉不得不深居简出——还好，她被软禁的地方提供了足够的书本，让她的日子不至于太过无聊。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","伊莎贝拉手中的死魂之书可以复刻现实的文字，因此在需要外出时，伊莎贝拉会事先在其中存上几本旅途中的读物。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","伊莎贝拉有着“被诅咒的天赋”，这既是形容她那天然的灾厄力量，又是形容她那强大到惊人的天赋水平。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","对于自己天然吸引着灾难与不幸的命运，伊莎贝拉心知肚明，就连她与姐姐西尔维娜的处境，也与她的这份力量不无关系。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","西尔维娜天生在情感的感受与表达上更加冷漠，但伊莎贝拉只是更善于隐藏自身的真实感受。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","如果伊莎贝拉愿意，她可以在一日内阅读完百万字的文本，有必要的话，甚至能熟练应用并背诵——但代价是之后会虚弱许多天。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","伊莎贝拉的运动能力就和西尔维娜的读书天赋一样的差。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","来，伊莎贝拉，先喝杯热牛奶。"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415667.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","西尔维娜 & 伊莎贝拉"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","稍微看会儿书吧"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415687.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","伊莎贝拉"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","蛋糕，很美味……"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415688.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","伊莎贝拉"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","……"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415733.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","伊莎贝拉 & 佐尔娅"]]}